{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>現年32歲的2017年港姐亞軍何依婷（Regina），2023年底宣布與大學同學兼富二代老公Cedric結婚，兩人在峇里舉行超夢幻婚禮，正式榮升闊太。出身基層、曾住黃大仙公屋的她，婚後正式搬入市值超過3,000萬元的紅磡「樓王」海名軒，曾曬出高層豪宅的極開揚維港海景，生活質素幾何級上升。何依婷近日為Cedric慶祝生日，飲到「醉醉哋」，更坐老公大髀扮咀咀慶祝，認真識冧老公！</p><figure><img alt=\"何依婷性感誘人。(何依婷IG)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260224/1103007561717911552672531.jpeg/s6zT7qaiIcwGUSN36PFxukH0qaE3CUavygW178oFte8\"/><figcaption>何依婷性感誘人。(何依婷IG)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"何依婷童心未泯。(ig@reginahyt)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260321/1112044115144871936280694.jpeg/1kNg8M8mCVj8YQJspWl38imBsbe-WWipxb5NfcW-TX0\"/><figcaption>何依婷童心未泯。(ig@reginahyt)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"何依婷幫女女搞咗個生日會。(ig@reginahyt)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260413/1120437866502033408650397.jpeg/UfkUhW8HMRFeb5fTW_dOWrgVrBxmLmE0skUXxLJFF8Q\"/><figcaption>何依婷幫女女搞咗個生日會。(ig@reginahyt)</figcaption></figure><p>何依婷坐富貴老公大髀咀咀合照</p><p>何依婷在Instagram限時動態曬出慶生片段。兩人挑選了一間面對海景的高級餐廳大歎西餐。食飯食到一半何依婷已經飲醉酒，被Cedric拍下醉態，她醉醺醺托住頭，並幸福發文道：「當你有個好鐘意飲酒的老公每次都要Wine Pairing 每次食飯到一半我都飲醉酒」。何依婷飲醉酒之餘，不忘坐上Cedric大髀，與老公扮咀咀影相，甜蜜又恩愛。</p><figure><img alt=\"何依婷為老公慶生。（IG圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260525/1135626994025893888310947.jpeg/6O91Wv5T4gipwI-0elt_EhcNk-_cAzeVdH5Q9nR-UPY\"/><figcaption>何依婷為老公慶生。（IG圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"何依婷飲醉酒。（IG圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260525/1135626991232356352603527.jpeg/r2IFerabAhpUhSI6VBzWmpVJ4gcM3FVxWWPFTFljxUw\"/><figcaption>何依婷飲醉酒。（IG圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"何依婷貴婦LOOK過生日。（IG：@reginahyt）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250224/970694602942320640761594.jpeg/bcNKuXzxZvbj3u7y5Panl3nPaZNpnsqhz7Umqc-1Jqk\"/><figcaption>何依婷貴婦LOOK過生日。（IG：@reginahyt）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"何依婷自2023年與圈外男友Cedric拉埋天窗後，便正式躋身「人生勝利組」。（IG@reginahyt）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260107/1085597948500250624058174.jpeg/-pn4oLedYiSUfhIPSiYNVMRmBCKqOGZQYuLqqmLi6qo\"/><figcaption>何依婷自2023年與圈外男友Cedric拉埋天窗後，便正式躋身「人生勝利組」。（IG@reginahyt）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"側面睇何依婷更瘦。(ig@reginahyt)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260321/1112044100929982464058796.jpeg/qPIdtev_xlYnw8QSQQWV-EcRrNCwNYobFz2g7xc9oO8\"/><figcaption>側面睇何依婷更瘦。(ig@reginahyt)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"何依婷條腰幼到呢。(ig@reginahyt)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260321/1112044103786434560470215.jpeg/IvZiQt12sbnqD7iY5vhEaqOxgTv_fppvPA8HPzwPBz8\"/><figcaption>何依婷條腰幼到呢。(ig@reginahyt)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"何依婷生完女女後，好快已經回復纖腰，但未去到依家咁瘦。(ig@reginahyt)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260321/1112044110459572224498150.jpeg/LkjYJsaFFucdNNQPZXWE-Y5zrCAgJdvJt0f867dH_Os\"/><figcaption>何依婷生完女女後，好快已經回復纖腰，但未去到依家咁瘦。(ig@reginahyt)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"何依婷條24吋纖腰開始出現啦。(ig@reginahyt)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260321/1112044108098048000867930.jpeg/2WRnSdcuAvsbaWvMRf0ZoColFS-HUcDbiDzdkYg83ZE\"/><figcaption>何依婷條24吋纖腰開始出現啦。(ig@reginahyt)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"何依婷帶住女女去主題樂園玩。(ig@reginahyt)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260321/1112044117699334144793021.jpeg/QgvFiSgVny2Bn-sdMhUuK7kzNQPwtkfSLPkAHCz5ABw\"/><figcaption>何依婷帶住女女去主題樂園玩。(ig@reginahyt)</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-25T12:39:52.170124+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":701,"images":12,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}